Debug mode highlights an `import X = A.B.c` alias of a qualified name only through `import X`, leaving the aliased name plain.
== args
--debug
input/import-alias-namespace.ts
== file input/import-alias-namespace.ts
import ReadFile = FS.readFileSync;
import MyUtil = MyNamespace.Utils.helper;
== stdout
«import ReadFile» = FS.readFileSync;
«import MyUtil» = MyNamespace.Utils.helper;
